herdr-mods
Mods for Herdr (https://herdr.dev).

Eight mods here are modified copies of mods shipped with herdr-app
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, Apache License 2.0). Changed from upstream:
  dg-agents            <- agents
  dg-changes             <- changes
  dg-files               <- files
  dg-spaces            <- spaces
  dg-tabs             <- tabs
  dg-workspace-status   <- workspace-status
  dg-workspace-chrome  <- workspace-chrome
  dg-new-menu          <- new-menu
Each of these carries changes from the upstream version; see its RECIPE.md.
The scheduling design of tools/tasks (the Tasks scheduler) is ported from
herdr-automations (MIT), https://github.com/DnzzL/herdr-automations; see tools/tasks/NOTICE.md.
